","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24421","id":482600467,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4MjYwMDQ2Nw==","user":{"login":"filipencus","id":21038775,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDM4Nzc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21038775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus","html_url":"https://github.com/filipencus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipencus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-12T14:42:37Z","updated_at":"2019-04-12T14:43:21Z","body":"Thank you @dulmandakh for taking your time to check it.\r\nI installed a new clean project with RN 0.59.1 and its working, but my current project was not.\r\n\r\nSo I removed \"mobx\" from babel.config and now its working.\r\nreact-native start --reset-cache\r\n\r\n`\r\nBEFORE\r\nmodule.exports = {\r\n  \"presets\": [\"module:metro-react-native-babel-preset\",\"mobx\"],\r\n  \"plugins\": [\r\n    [\"@babel/plugin-proposal-decorators\", { \"legacy\": true }]\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\nAFTER:\r\nmodule.exports = {\r\n  \"presets\": [\"module:metro-react-native-babel-preset\"],\r\n  \"plugins\": [\r\n    [\"@babel/plugin-proposal-decorators\", { \"legacy\": true }]\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n` \r\nI guess there is a conflict when using RN and mobx together...\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"ur