w==","user":{"login":"timomeara","id":5084668,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODQ2Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5084668?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara","html_url":"https://github.com/timomeara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-12T15:14:14Z","updated_at":"2019-04-12T15:14:14Z","body":"> Could you please provide reproducible demo code. Also, key is special property to identify and ensure uniqueness of an item in data, so please use other properties. Below code works for me.\r\n> \r\n> ```js\r\n> <FlatList data={[{key: 'a', name: 'a'}, {key: 'b', name: 'b'}]} renderItem={({item}) => <Text>{item.name}</Text>} />\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nit looks like this is caused by:\r\n@babel/plugin-proposal-class-properties in the babel.config\r\nhere's a test app the demonstrates the problem, albeit, not really a react-native one \r\n[FlatListTest.zip](https://github.com/facebook/react-native/files/3073917/FlatListTest.zip)\r\n\r\nthanks for the help and the quick responses\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/482612337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"timomeara","id":5084668,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODQ2Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5084668?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara","html_url":"https://github.com/timomeara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timomeara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/487809497","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/24421#issuecomment-487809497","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24421","id":487809497,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4NzgwOTQ5Nw==","user":{"login":"quietrun","id":8054168,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTQxNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8054168?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun","html_url":"https://github.com/quietrun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-30T03:11:30Z","updated_at":"2019-04-30T03:11:30Z","body":"@filipencus hi, i use the same configuration，mobx and react-native 0.59.I used to get the same bug，but I found an effective method, it's useful in my project, maybe you can try this.\r\nI delete my .babelrc and babel.config, and i add this code to my package.json\r\n`\"babel\": {\r\n    \"plugins\": [\r\n      [\r\n        \"@babel/plugin-proposal-decorators\",\r\n        {\r\n          \"legacy\": true\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"@babel/plugin-proposal-class-properties\",\r\n        {\r\n          \"loose\": true\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    ]\r\n  }`\r\nBy this way, i can use mobx and react-native as usual.And <FlatList> never throw error again.\r\nI guess there is something wrong in mobx's bable configuration.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/487809497/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"quietrun","id":8054168,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTQxNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8054168?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun","html_url":"https://github.com/quietrun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quietrun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.githu